# RocketRide — AI assistant instructions

The canonical contributor guide is `AGENTS.md` at the repository root. Read it
first; it routes every task (integration code, nodes, clients, MCP, engine) to
the right documentation under `docs/`.

Before writing any RocketRide integration code, read
`docs/agents/ROCKETRIDE_QUICKSTART.md` and the other `ROCKETRIDE_*` files in
`docs/agents/`. If a request is ambiguous, stop and ask — do not guess.
